.TH DISKANVIL 1 "October 2026" "diskanvil @PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
diskanvil \- disk manager and partition editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B diskanvil
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B diskanvil
shows every disk as a bar of partitions sized to scale, with a list of volumes above it, in the
style of Windows Disk Management. From the window you can mount and unmount volumes, format
them, create, delete and resize partitions, change labels, and write new GPT or MBR partition
tables.
.PP
The program runs as the calling user. It never opens block devices itself; every change is a
request to UDisks2, which asks for authorization through polkit. Disks holding a mount outside
.IR /run/media ,
.I /media
or
.IR /mnt ,
or an active swap partition, are treated as system disks and are never modified.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-dump
Print the disk layout as text and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-select " device"
Start with the partition
.I device
(for example
.IR /dev/sdb1 )
selected.
.TP
.BI \-\-screenshot " file"
Render the main window to
.I file
and exit. Works with
.BR QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen .
.TP
.BI \-\-open " tool"
Open just one tool, without the main window:
.BR what-happened ,
.BR write-image ,
.BR windows-usb ,
.BR rescue-usb ,
.BR live-on-pc ,
.BR check-stick ,
.BR lost-files ,
.BR virus-scan ,
.BR save-files ,
.BR remote-help ,
.BR net-boot ,
.BR product-key ,
.BR drivers ,
.BR boot-menu ,
.BR linux-boot ,
.BR make-room ,
.B certificates
or
.BR open-sets .
DiskAnvil closes when the tool is closed.
.TP
.B \-\-home
Be DiskAnvil Live's home screen, the desktop with the big tiles.
.TP
.BI \-\-log " file"
Write what DiskAnvil does to
.IR file :
every request to UDisks2 and its result, every result shown, and Qt's warnings, one timestamped
line each. What a request carries (passphrases among it) is never written.
.B DISKANVIL_LOG=\fIfile\fP
in the environment does the same.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the available options.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show the version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 if UDisks2 cannot be reached.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR udisksctl (1),
.BR lsblk (8),
.BR polkit (8)
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/DannyS124/diskanvil/issues
